{"t":"Favour of the Ancients","s":"favour-of-the-ancients-9e00f","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Cryptic_Fossil_7cac2b.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancestral%20Charge\">Ancestral Charge</a> </i> </span>\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Favour of the Ancients</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F15.20.7a5cc9\">15.20.7a5cc9</a><br/>November 24, 2025<br/>Winter Update 2025</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<b>Favour of the Ancients</b>, introduced with Winter Update 2025, is a charge that grants access to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Unhallowed%20Crypt\">Unhallowed Crypts</a>. Each time a player enters the hunting ground, one charge is consumed. Players can see their current amount of charges on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Log\">Quest Log</a>, after finishing <a href=\"#/quest/the-roost-of-the-graveborn-quest\">The Roost of the Graveborn Quest</a>, under \"The Spirits Are At Ease\".\n<p>In order the obtain more charges, players can:\n</p>\n<ul><li>use <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cryptic%20Fossil\"><img alt=\"Cryptic Fossil\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cryptic_Fossil_7cac2b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Cryptic%20Fossil\">Cryptic Fossils</a>, which grant 1 charge each</li>\n<li>use <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Jade%20Dragon%20Head%20%28Charged%29\"><img alt=\"Jade Dragon Head (Charged)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jade_Dragon_Head_Charged_4be0ac.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Jade%20Dragon%20Head%20%28Charged%29\">Jade Dragon Head (Charged)</a>, which grants 1 charge and can be used every two weeks cooldown (also grants one <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancestral%20Charge\">Ancestral Charge</a>)</li></ul></div>","quests":["the-roost-of-the-graveborn-quest"]}